---
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<section id="hero" class="relative pt-36 pb-20 md:pt-48 md:pb-28 border-b border-white/10 overflow-hidden min-h-[92vh] flex flex-col justify-between">
  <!-- Subtle architectural coordinate grid background -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#ffffff04_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#ffffff04_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:6rem_6rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_70%_60%_at_50%_0%,#000_80%,transparent_100%)] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 w-full relative z-10 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between">
    <!-- Top Ledger Row -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-6 mb-12 sm:mb-16" data-intro data-reveal="fade">
      <div class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#7e8594] flex items-center gap-3">
        <span>ARCHITEKTURA SYSTEMÓW AGENTOWYCH & B2B</span>
      </div>
      <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#7e8594]">
        POLSKA GRUPA PROPTECH • WARSZAWA
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Mega Typographic Statement Poster -->
    <div class="max-w-6xl my-auto py-4">
      <h1 
        class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[5.25rem] font-bold text-white tracking-[-0.04em] leading-[0.98] text-balance mb-8"
        data-intro
        data-split="lines"
      >
        Większość ludzi traci rok na błędy, które ktoś inny rozwiązał w 6 tygodni.
      </h1>

      <p 
        class="text-lg sm:text-2xl text-[#7e8594] font-body max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-pretty"
        data-intro
        data-reveal="up"
        data-delay="0.1"
      >
        Zamiast błądzić w samotności metodą prób i błędów: przejmij sprawdzony system inżynierski, zaoszczędź czas i rozwijaj rozwiązania u siebie.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Architectural Delta Bar -->
    <div 
      class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-start"
      data-intro
      data-reveal="up"
      data-delay="0.2"
    >
      <a 
        href="#warsztaty" 
        class="group space-y-2 block"
        data-cursor="Program"
      >
        <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline font-mono text-xs text-[#7e8594]">
          <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors">01 / WARSZTATY</span>
          <span>6 TYGODNI</span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">
          Orkiestracja AI w firmie
        </div>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#7e8594]">
          1 200 PLN • Zniżka z kodem do 0 PLN
        </div>
      </a>

      <a 
        href="#mentoring" 
        class="group space-y-2 block"
        data-cursor="Termin"
      >
        <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline font-mono text-xs text-[#7e8594]">
          <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors">02 / MENTORING BIZNES</span>
          <span>90 MINUT</span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">
          Diagnoza & Granty B+R
        </div>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#7e8594]">
          400 PLN • Sesja 1:1 online
        </div>
      </a>

      <a 
        href="#mentoring" 
        class="group space-y-2 block"
        data-cursor="Termin"
      >
        <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline font-mono text-xs text-[#7e8594]">
          <span class="group-hover:text-white transition-colors">03 / MENTORING KARIERA</span>
          <span>90 MINUT</span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">
          Audyt profilu & Rynek
        </div>
        <div class="font-mono text-xs text-[#7e8594]">
          300 PLN • Realia selekcji
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
